      "jp": "ふぅ、だいぶいい感じに走れたかな。^00ちょっとずつ記録が伸びていくの……^00とっても嬉しくて、やりがいがあるんだよね",
      "en_original": "Phew, I guess I did okay on my last run. My lap times are getting better! That always makes me so happy.",
      "en_auxiliary": "Phew, I guess I did okay on my last run. My lap times are getting better! That always makes me so happy.",
      "en": "Phew, I guess I did okay on my last run. My lap times are getting better! That always makes me so happy.",
