      },
      "jp": "さて、あともう１セット……。^00香織が戻って来たときに、^00遅いって言われないようにしなくちゃね！",
      "en_original": "Okay, one more set... I'll have to keep practicing for Kaori! She'd be disappointed if I was too slow!",
      "en_auxiliary": "Okay, one more set. I'll have to keep practicing for Kaori! She'd be disappointed if I were too slow!",
